<title>JAPAN: Leader Electronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Leader Electronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.65		vs	    2.37</p>
<p> Operating    loss 47 million	 vs   loss 110 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 39 million	 vs    loss 96 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 46 million	 vs   loss 102 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 11.10 yen	  vs    loss 24.52 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Leader Electronics Corp manufactures measuring instruments for TV and FM makers.</p>
